<item><title>Tunisia’s oil union cancels three-day hydrocarbon transport strike</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-oil-union-cancels-three-day-hydrocarbon-transport-8413bb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-oil-union-cancels-three-day-hydrocarbon-transport-8413bb/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The union cited the start of workers’ social coverage regularisation and implementation of a 2019 agreement, but says other demands remain.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:32:13 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia forecasts cooler temperatures and northern rain on Friday</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-forecasts-cooler-temperatures-and-northern-rain-on-1e78cb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-forecasts-cooler-temperatures-and-northern-rain-on-1e78cb/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>Highs will range from 20°C to 25°C in the north and centre, while the sea will be very rough in the north.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:15:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisian appeals court upholds three-year terms for Ennahdha&apos;s Lourimi and Gharbi</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisian-appeals-court-upholds-three-year-terms-for-962abf/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisian-appeals-court-upholds-three-year-terms-for-962abf/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The terrorism chamber confirmed the July first-instance verdict, with Lourimi convicted for failing to report information about a terror crime.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:09:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia convenes exporters and power company over summer outages</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-convenes-exporters-and-power-company-over-summer-3cc398/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-convenes-exporters-and-power-company-over-summer-3cc398/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>Nearly 90 export manufacturers are meeting the state power company and officials in Tunis to discuss supply security and prepare for summer 2027.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:15:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-convenes-exporters-and-power-company-over-summer-3cc398/share.jpg" length="43670" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-convenes-exporters-and-power-company-over-summer-3cc398/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
